The important thing to
remember is that these are all

00:13:26.315 --> 00:13:28.675
considered strong electrolytes.

00:13:29.435 --> 00:13:32.585
Which means that they're all soluble.

00:13:32.765 --> 00:13:35.495
Okay, so these are very, very soluble.

00:13:36.445 --> 00:13:39.725
Um, and you can see that there's a note
here that says that some of them are

00:13:39.725 --> 00:13:45.115
slightly, right, the group 2 elements
are slightly soluble, but the rest of

00:13:45.115 --> 00:13:46.925
them are considered strong electrolytes.

00:13:47.324 --> 00:13:48.435
They fully dissolve.

00:13:48.555 --> 00:13:52.845
So all of these, let's say if I
were to write like, uh, HBr for

